OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Harbour Master 'chuffed'
OL,4,Awith maritime award
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's former harbour master said he
OL,7,Fwas "chuffed" to be given the Merchant
OL,8,FNavy Medal for Meritorious Service.
OL,10,FThe awards are given out on Merchant
OL,11,FNavy Day, 3 September, to mark the
OL,12,Fcontribution of the UK's merchant
OL,13,Fseafarers and their role in supporting
OL,14,Fglobal trade, tourism and national
OL,15,Fsecurity.
OL,17,FCaptain Brian Nibbs, 87, has been given
OL,18,Fthe award for his voluntary work in the
OL,19,Fmaritime after a career as a seafarer
OL,20,Fwhich spanned five decades.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
