OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Harbour Master 'chuffed'
OL,4,Awith maritime award
OL,5,
OL,6,FNibbs said: "The news came by email and
OL,7,FI thought this is fantastic but what
OL,8,Fhave I done to deserve this? But it was
OL,9,Ffor recognition of support of maritime
OL,10,Fcharities and when I look back then I
OL,11,Frealised I'd enjoyed doing it."
